<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: armor-piercing -->
  <FT_Gun_TurretAT.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.0.label>穿甲弹</FT_Gun_TurretAT.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.0.label>
  <!-- EN: Solid shot with a small bursting charge. Best against armor and machines. -->
  <FT_Gun_TurretAT.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.0.description>带少量炸药的实心弹，最适合对付装甲与机械体。</FT_Gun_TurretAT.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.0.description>
  <!-- EN: high-explosive -->
  <FT_Gun_TurretAT.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.1.label>高爆弹</FT_Gun_TurretAT.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.1.label>
  <!-- EN: Thin-walled shell with a large charge. Little penetration, but the blast catches groups of infantry. -->
  <FT_Gun_TurretAT.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.1.description>薄壳大装药的炮弹。穿透力低，但爆炸能波及成群的步兵。</FT_Gun_TurretAT.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.1.description>
  
