  <!-- EN: armor-piercing tracer -->
  <FT_Gun_TurretAA.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.0.label>穿甲曳光弹</FT_Gun_TurretAA.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.0.label>
  <!-- EN: Uranium-cored tracer rounds for direct hits. -->
  <FT_Gun_TurretAA.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.0.description>铀芯曳光弹，用于直接命中。</FT_Gun_TurretAA.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.0.description>
  <!-- EN: airburst -->
  <FT_Gun_TurretAA.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.1.label>空爆弹</FT_Gun_TurretAA.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.1.label>
  <!-- EN: Time-fused rounds that burst just short of the target and spray fragments over an area. Weak against armor. -->
  <FT_Gun_TurretAA.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.1.description>定时引信弹，在目标前方炸开，将破片洒向一片区域。对装甲效果差。</FT_Gun_TurretAA.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.1.description>
  
