  <!-- EN: armor-piercing -->
  <FT_Gun_TurretEmpero.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.0.label>穿甲弹</FT_Gun_TurretEmpero.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.0.label>
  <!-- EN: Heavy solid shot that punches through the thickest armor. Small blast. -->
  <FT_Gun_TurretEmpero.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.0.description>能贯穿最厚装甲的重型实心弹，爆炸范围小。</FT_Gun_TurretEmpero.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.0.description>
  <!-- EN: high-explosive -->
  <FT_Gun_TurretEmpero.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.1.label>高爆弹</FT_Gun_TurretEmpero.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.1.label>
  <!-- EN: Heavy high-explosive shell. Low penetration, wide concussive blast. -->
  <FT_Gun_TurretEmpero.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.1.description>重型高爆弹。穿透力低，震荡爆炸范围大。</FT_Gun_TurretEmpero.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.1.description>
  <!-- EN: smoke -->
  <FT_Gun_TurretEmpero.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.2.label>烟雾弹</FT_Gun_TurretEmpero.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.2.label>
  <!-- EN: Lays a smoke screen at the target. Does no damage. -->
  <FT_Gun_TurretEmpero.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.2.description>在目标处施放烟幕，不造成伤害。</FT_Gun_TurretEmpero.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.2.description>
  
